# Requiem over Doom II MAP01 (P10): from the map's start, no monsters: the player walks to the exit,
# through the doors on the way (and the keys they need), and leaves the level, the last
# tic. Written by tools/RouteGen (requiem-map01-walk-exit).
iwad doom2
pwad requiem
map MAP01
exit normal
